id=universal_debloat
name=Universal Debloat (Editable Hide List)
version=v3.1.1
versionCode=5
author=Alaa91H
description=Systemless manager for unwanted built-in apps. Interactive recovery installer (volume-key menus: preset, uninstall/disable, clean-ROM) with non-interactive fallback. Reads an editable config (/data/adb/debloat_list.conf). Works on any device and any ROM with KernelSU or Magisk. Removing the module restores everything.
